 "gives a Dataset with one row per candidate of the \
[StructureAdaptiveEvolution](paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/\
ref/StructureAdaptiveEvolution) result ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["result", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "bd85e320-133e-8441-bc3b-77742b644484"],
 "."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->166345877,ExpressionUUID->"21e1038c-0930-264c-a863-caa5835b6ade"],

Cell["\<\
Columns: short candidate, evaluation and parent IDs, strategy, status, \
canonical rule and initial state, state and transition counts, longest \
derivation, maximum vertex and edge counts, the BFS-depth lifetime, halting, \
runtime and Pareto membership (\"Solution\", \"Search\" or \"None\").\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->715169282,ExpressionUUID->"e9b671b6-1180-e449-804a-45194a69cd9c"],

Cell["\<\
It uses only the data stored in the result; nothing is evolved or evaluated \
again.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->760757797,ExpressionUUID->"9653542c-9204-a64a-a11d-4374f1258c8c"]
}, Open  ]],

